<h2 id=3D"intuition">Intuition</h2>
<p>At first, it might strike you as strange that this problem is in the <em=
>Binary Search</em> chapter. The given input array isn't necessarily sorted=
, so how is binary search applicable here? Well, this is an example of a co=
mmon application of binary search, where the search space does not encompas=
s the input array.</p>
